{"unit_id":"STARDUSTLC666__dsh-docker#card-zh","repo":"STARDUSTLC666/dsh-docker","commit":"e344fb2f23609843a063a59a5b5f70b71c382ef9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-docker 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的 Docker 管理工具插件，通过 DSH 工具接口注册容器与镜像操作。它可以列出容器和镜像、查看容器日志与详情、检查 Docker 引擎状态，并在容器内执行命令或启动、停止、重启和删除容器。命令执行和停止、重启、删除操作默认接入宿主审批。适合需要在 DSH 会话中查看和维护本机 Docker 环境的用户；需要本机可访问 Docker Engine 与 Docker CLI。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:21-68","lib/tools.js:120-347","lib/config.js:9-26"]}
{"unit_id":"STARDUSTLC666__dsh-docker#card-en","repo":"STARDUSTLC666/dsh-docker","commit":"e344fb2f23609843a063a59a5b5f70b71c382ef9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-docker adds Docker tools to DSH web. It lists containers and images, reads container details and logs, checks Docker availability, runs container commands, and manages containers. Command execution and destructive actions use host approval by default. Requires Docker Engine and CLI.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:21-68","lib/tools.js:120-347","lib/config.js:9-26"]}
{"unit_id":"STARDUSTLC666__dsh-docker#feature-1","repo":"STARDUSTLC666/dsh-docker","commit":"e344fb2f23609843a063a59a5b5f70b71c382ef9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-docker 的功能「查看容器」：通过 docker_ps 列出容器的名称、镜像和状态，可选择包含已停止的容器并按名称筛选。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:123-156"]}
{"unit_id":"STARDUSTLC666__dsh-docker#feature-2","repo":"STARDUSTLC666/dsh-docker","commit":"e344fb2f23609843a063a59a5b5f70b71c382ef9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-docker 的功能「查看镜像」：通过 docker_images 列出本地镜像的仓库、标签、大小和创建时间，也可只筛选悬空镜像。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:189-214"]}
